WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
The roof must result from a valid

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:02.760
act of making.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.660
Perform the actual preparation.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.640
Planning alone cannot replace action, either in

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:08.940
habit practice or construction.
